data: {"id": "b1d3ae28d82c4f0e-thinking-parallel_evidence-383", "run_id": "b1d3ae28d82c4f0e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "所有必要工具均已执行，结果摘要如下：\n\n1. **Kubernetes 实体身份**：\n   - Pod `workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462` (UID: `7f2eda43-58bc-4f48-bb8a-02435553f7d1`) 位于 namespace `aiops-case-08`，当前状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n\n2. **Kubernetes 描述与事件 (kubectl_describe / kubectl_events)**：\n   - 容器 `app` 的退出原因 (`Reason`) 明确为 **`OOMKilled`**，退出码 (Exit Code) 为 **`137`**。\n   - 事件日志显示 `Back-off restarting failed container app...`，累计重启达 `378` 次。\n\n3. **初步结论与缺口**：\n   - **事实支持**：CrashLoopBackOff 的直接原因是进程因内存超限被内核 OOM Killer 强杀。\n   - **当前缺口**：已确认“内存超限”", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789083819230, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

