data: {"id": "b1d3ae28d82c4f0e-final", "run_id": "b1d3ae28d82c4f0e", "seq": 388, "ts_ms": 1789083839888, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器进程持续被 OOM Killer 强杀。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `kubernetes` (fact-205d4301f9f7) | Container `app` 最后终止原因为 `OOMKilled` | 直接指示进程是被内核 OOM Killer 强制终止的 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `kubernetes` (fact-4de299c0fe69) | Container `app` 的 `memory limit` 设置为 `64Mi` | 提供了导致 OOM 的具体资源限制配置依据 |\n| 3 | Logging | `elasticsearch` (fact-3655a8adf704) | 8 条聚合日志：`http_request /work` 成功，`allocated_mib` 从 `10` 增长至 `48` | 确认了触发 OOM 前应用正在进行特定的内存分配活动 |\n| 4 | Tracing | `deepflow` (fact-03d3b8c18cb7) | 9 次聚合 Flow：`GET /work`，状态 `200`，耗时 `10243us-103360us` | 验证了导致内存增长的业务活动是受控的 API 请求 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n- 证据 1（OOMKilled）与证据 3（内存增长）在因果链上紧密衔接，说明 64Mi 的限制不足以容纳日志记录的增长至 48Mi 的分配动作（事实表明增长趋势已非常接近硬限制）。\n- 证据 3 与证据 4 关联了业务请求（`/work`），确认了导致资源异常消耗的具体业务场景。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存限制过低（64Mi） → 业务请求导致内存分配突破限制 → 触发内核 OOM Killer → 进程异常退出（Exit Code 137）→ 持续重启形成 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：应用容器内存硬限制配置过低，引发内核 OOM Killer 终止进程。**\n\n依据证据 1（K8s 状态 `OOMKilled`）与证据 2（硬限制 `64Mi`），容器内的进程在运行时因内存超出 64Mi 的限制被内核强制杀死了。证据 3 的日志表明，应用在处理业务时内存使用量已攀升至 48Mi，随着进一步请求接近硬限制，导致了最终的内存溢出。由于容器重启（证据 4 的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态）时未改变资源限制，该问题导致 Pod 进入持续的崩溃重启循环。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 49.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462: 49.1s (Evidence 37.8s, RCA 11.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 75.379, "metrics": {"run_id": "b1d3ae28d82c4f0e", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 75.39134907722473, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 75391.34907722473, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 59919.34537887573, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 32310.6689453125, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 15097.188949584961}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16966.140031814575, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 49093.82390975952, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9305.303573608398, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

